    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d176">

                <pb facs="0353" n="253" sameAs="frus:frus1884/pg253"/>

                <head>No. 176.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Queen to
                        the President.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1884-07-21"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 21,
                        1884</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>To the <hi rendition="#small-caps">President of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>The Queen heartily congratulates the President and people of the United States on
                    the rescue of Lieutenant Greely and the gallant survivors of the Arctic
                    expedition.</p>
                <p>She trusts that favorable reports have been received of the sufferers.</p>
                <closer>THE QUEEN,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Windsor Castle.</hi></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
